# EEBBK A3 fix: the duplicate "config TOUCHSCREEN_FTS" block that used to
# live here (bool + depends on undefined TOUCHSCREEN_FTS_CHIPSET) overrode
# the tristate definition in drivers/input/touchscreen/Kconfig and forced
# CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_FTS back to "n". Removed, so -y from defconfig sticks.
# Only the directory string option is declared here.
